    "text": "110 Gutshot Straight While ADS : -15% ↑-10%? Auto Aim Cone Size and increased Non-Precision Non-Weakspot Damage , 20% Increased Non-Precision Damage : Auto Rifles, Bows, Hand Cannons, Scout Rifles, and Sniper Rifles . 10% Increased Non-Precision Damage : Machine Guns , Pulse Rifles, Sidearm, Submachine Guns, and Trace Rifles .",
    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 89px\"><th id=\"1662574278R109\" style=\"height: 89px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 89px\">110</div></th><td class=\"s27\">Gutshot Straight</td><td class=\"s25\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:89px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYa9A0fEnhwkbUwf8O0v7dKHsp5iabfv7ufSlmuWfl9cud9ZJtgyh-koC56zR9DBC_y58Ck3nBox_tr6n4M8HqC_Ayjb3ad_jOkNBrocTxq3Vpqi0XI5BmHoALOmDFJa03zkSjrt1XSCjncgUKVCcb96CObHVv47O4Z=w70-h89\" title=\"Image\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s19\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">While </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;\">ADS</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">:<br></span> -15% <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑-10%?</span> Auto Aim Cone Size and increased <span style=\"color:#999999;\">Non-Precision </span><span style=\"color:#e69138;\">Non-Weakspot</span><span style=\"color:#999999;\"> Damage</span>,<br><br>20% Increased <span style=\"color:#999999;\">Non-Precision Damage</span>: Auto Rifles, Bows, Hand Cannons, Scout Rifles, and <span style=\"color:#a481e1;\">Sniper Rifles</span>.<br>10% Increased <span style=\"color:#999999;\">Non-Precision Damage</span>: <span style=\"color:#a481e1;\">Machine Guns</span>, Pulse Rifles, Sidearm, Submachine Guns, and <span style=\"color:#63d275;\">Trace Rifles</span>.</td></tr>",
